WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:06.779
There are 24 hours in a day, and on October
27th, 2017, that's not going to be enough.

00:00:06.779 --> 00:00:11.429
For pop culture junkies, the last Friday in
October is shaping up to be one of the busiest

00:00:11.429 --> 00:00:14.459
and most exciting release days in recent memory.

00:00:14.459 --> 00:00:16.280
You've got new video game releases.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:20.130
You have a brand new season of one of the
most binge-worthy shows on television.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:25.020
You have an entire slate of geek-friendly
feature films making their long-awaited debuts.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.850
The hard part is choosing which one to go
after first.

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:32.770
After all, you only have so much time — and
on days like this, every second is precious.

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:34.500
Here's why.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.300
Stranger Things Season 2

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.980
The first season of Stranger Things practically
perfected the art of the cliffhanger, and

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:46.329
the finale ended on a doozy: Will Byers, fresh
off his adventures in the Upside Down, excuses

00:00:46.329 --> 00:00:51.510
himself to go wash his hands — and promptly
vomits a slug into the bathroom sink.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:54.260
On October 27th, we'll find out what that
means.

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:58.690
Netflix will release all nine episodes of
Stranger Things' sophomore effort at once,

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:03.330
giving fans plenty to chew on as they unravel
the show's lingering mysteries while getting

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.189
tangled up in all new ones.

00:01:05.189 --> 00:01:09.710
Expect some answers, and even more questions,
alongside all of the '80s nostalgia you can

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.159
handle, when Stranger Things returns.

00:01:12.159 --> 00:01:15.579
Just don't expect to see poor Barb this time
around.

00:01:15.579 --> 00:01:17.310
Assassin's Creed Origins

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:21.399
Over the past nine games plus a handful of
spin-offs, Assassin's Creed has tracked the

00:01:21.399 --> 00:01:24.389
Assassin vs Templar conflict through the centuries.

00:01:24.389 --> 00:01:28.329
In the 2017 installment, we're going all the
way back to the beginning.

00:01:28.329 --> 00:01:33.630
On October 27th, Assassin's Creed Origins
will drop players into a vibrant, open-world

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:35.810
recreation of ancient Egypt.

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:39.719
Sure, you'll still be scaling buildings — and
in this case, some pyramids — and sneaking

00:01:39.719 --> 00:01:40.850
up on foes.

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:44.880
But despite the ancient setting, Origins is
shaping up to be the most modern Assassin's

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:45.900
Creed yet.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:50.340
Instead of climbing towers, you can dispatch
an eagle to scout out the land around you.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:53.869
Camels join horses and boats as methods of
transportation.

00:01:53.869 --> 00:01:58.389
Combat is getting a Dark Souls-inspired overhaul,
while a Destiny-like loot system will make

00:01:58.389 --> 00:02:03.090
exploring Assassin's Creed Origins' massive
open world much more satisfying.

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:05.299
Wolfenstein 2: The New Colossus

00:02:05.299 --> 00:02:10.209
Bethesda will once again allow gamers to partake
in some fascist-smashing action this fall

00:02:10.209 --> 00:02:13.500
with the release of Wolfenstein 2: The New
Colossus.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:19.110
Like the 2016 DOOM reboot, 2014's Wolfenstein:
The New Order took the best elements from

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:23.360
older Wolfenstein games and gussied them up
for a discerning modern audience.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:27.650
The New Colossus looks like it's going to
be more of the same — just, y'know, better.

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:28.650
Hero B.J.

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:33.980
Blazkowicz returns on October 27th, ready
to take the fight to America's Nazi occupiers

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.349
yet again.

00:02:35.349 --> 00:02:40.040
Like its predecessor, The New Colossus will
feature old-school gameplay — no auto-regenerating

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:44.820
health here — and alternate spins on iconic
American locations, including Roswell, New

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:47.950
Mexico and a bombed-out New York City.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:50.290
Professor Marston &amp; the Wonder Women

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:54.849
The backstory for comics icon Wonder Woman
doesn't hold a candle to that of her creator,

00:02:54.849 --> 00:02:56.459
Dr. William Marston.

00:02:56.459 --> 00:03:01.430
Not only did Marston, a trained psychiatrist,
help invent the polygraph, but he believed

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:05.430
that women were naturally better than men,
and that true happiness could only be found

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:10.200
by giving in to "loving submission," literally
— the guy was big into BDSM.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:14.739
Marston was also one-third of a polyamorous
relationship between himself, his wife Elizabeth,

00:03:14.739 --> 00:03:15.909
and their partner, Olive.

00:03:15.909 --> 00:03:21.359
All in all, there's tons of drama to mine
from Marson's life, even before the rope-wielding,

00:03:21.359 --> 00:03:23.420
lie-detecting Wonder Woman gets involved.

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:28.329
If Professor Marston &amp; the Wonder Women delivers
on its potential on October 27th, it should

00:03:28.329 --> 00:03:33.019
be an even better origin story than the Amazon's
big-budget counterpart from earlier in the

00:03:33.019 --> 00:03:34.340
year.

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.340
Jigsaw

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:39.760
Saw's signature villain met his demise at
the end of Saw III, and the rest of the series

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:44.440
is carried on by his proteges, who consider
themselves responsible for continuing Jigsaw's

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.480
good works.

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:46.609
But is that changing?

00:03:46.609 --> 00:03:49.430
In the upcoming Jigsaw, bodies start piling
up.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:52.860
And according to the evidence, Jigsaw himself
is responsible.

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:55.700
There's just one problem: he's been dead for
10 years.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:04:00.319
Even without Jigsaw's brand-name appeal, that's
a compelling set-up for a mystery, and should

00:04:00.319 --> 00:04:04.959
be enough to get gore-hounds of all types
into theaters when Jigsaw premieres on October

00:04:04.959 --> 00:04:05.959
27th.

00:04:05.959 --> 00:04:10.269
The series' brutal traps will return, but
with a new and updated tone that the director

00:04:10.269 --> 00:04:15.290
says is "not quite as vicious and more fun,"
as well as a few plot twists primed to blow

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.140
audiences away.

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:19.040
Super Mario Odyssey

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:23.730
In March, it was hard to imagine that the
Nintendo Switch would get a better game in

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:26.550
2017 than The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the
Wild.

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:28.060
Then, Mario happened.

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:33.100
In Super Mario Odyssey, Nintendo's plucky
plumber ditches the Mushroom Kingdom for strange

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:37.480
new worlds, where he'll hunt for the Power
Moons that fuel his extradimensional ship.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:41.630
In Odyssey's biggest gameplay twist, Mario
can hurl his hat — which is now a living

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:47.090
being named Cappy — onto friends and enemies
alike, possessing them and taking their powers.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:51.720
The hat-tossing mechanic was everything that
Odyssey needed to walk away victorious at

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.530
E3 2017, but there's more to the game than
that.

00:04:54.530 --> 00:05:00.340
Like Super Mario 64 and Super Mario Sunshine,
Super Mario Odyssey emphasizes exploration

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:04.700
over progression, with more collectibles to
find than any other game in the series.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:09.600
The levels, meanwhile, look to be the most
diverse collection of settings in Mario history.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:14.980
All that, and Bowser rocks an all-white tuxedo
and top hat, like some kind of big, scaly,

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:15.980
fancy lizard-man.

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:18.820
Can October 27th just get here already?

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:20.060
Thanks for watching!

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:23.070
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:25.130
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

